(3892239, 552819, 67152, '<td valign="top">you have those nightmares, too?  love the blue tint and the really scary face - but you really have to update the posters on your walls - guns n'' roses?  Come On!!!</td>', 'you have those nightmares, too?  love the blue tint and the really scary face - but you really have to update the posters on your walls - guns n'' roses?  Come On!!!', '2007-07-11 07:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3892244, 552579, 67152, '<td valign="top">i like the subtleness of the face in the corner - but there is something about the angle of the light and cropping on the bed that could use some work to boost it a little</td>', 'i like the subtleness of the face in the corner - but there is something about the angle of the light and cropping on the bed that could use some work to boost it a little', '2007-07-11 07:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3892247, 550185, 67152, '<td valign="top">being without beer is really a nightmare, but I really have to argue with your beverage of choice...  i like the lighting and the skewed angle of the shot - and the ''uncleanliness'' of the fridge - good fun take on the challenge</td>', 'being without beer is really a nightmare, but I really have to argue with your beverage of choice...  i like the lighting and the skewed angle of the shot - and the ''uncleanliness'' of the fridge - good fun take on the challenge', '2007-07-11 07:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3892249, 552692, 67152, '<td valign="top">really dramatic colors and lighting and choice of long exposure to create emotion.</td>', 'really dramatic colors and lighting and choice of long exposure to create emotion.', '2007-07-11 07:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3892251, 551005, 67152, '<td valign="top">interesting shapes and tones - but the image seems overexposed - the background is really quite bright and the foreground and floor don''t seem all that natural.</td>', 'interesting shapes and tones - but the image seems overexposed - the background is really quite bright and the foreground and floor don''t seem all that natural.', '2007-07-11 07:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3892256, 551719, 67152, '<td valign="top">you have a serious insect/ arachnid problem on your hands... there are many really nice details to this photo that make it stand out -  the shadows surrounding the poor girl, the choice of nightgown, the angle of the shot, the lighting on her face - it all works really well.  10</td>', 'you have a serious insect/ arachnid problem on your hands... there are many really nice details to this photo that make it stand out -  the shadows surrounding the poor girl, the choice of nightgown, the angle of the shot, the lighting on her face - it all works really well.  10', '2007-07-11 07:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3892258, 552931, 67152, '<td valign="top">i have that fear too...i love looking at dams and bridges but I always worry I am going to tumble.  This image is in great need of better lighting.  The perspective and colors are very solid - but the shadows overtake the whole image and it will likely impact your score.  Still, I like the effort 6</td>', 'i have that fear too...i love looking at dams and bridges but I always worry I am going to tumble.  This image is in great need of better lighting.  The perspective and colors are very solid - but the shadows overtake the whole image and it will likely impact your score.  Still, I like the effort 6', '2007-07-11 07:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3892259, 552843, 67152, '<td valign="top">This one is a little TOO close to home for me...having my DSLR and lenses break is a real nightmare for me.  A big wave took my camera out about 2 weeks ago. <br/> <br/>I like the shot - the angle and shallow DOF work well, but the lighting and focus on the lens in front could use a little improvement.  good effort</td>', 'This one is a little TOO close to home for me...having my DSLR and lenses break is a real nightmare for me.  A big wave took my camera out about 2 weeks ago.  I like the shot - the angle and shallow DOF work well, but the lighting and focus on the lens in front could use a little improvement.  good effort', '2007-07-11 07:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3892263, 552694, 67152, '<td valign="top">the red glow from underneath the bed is excellent, but the hand almost seems ''too much'' to me - the face and the lighting were enough to make it really creapy for me...</td>', 'the red glow from underneath the bed is excellent, but the hand almost seems ''too much'' to me - the face and the lighting were enough to make it really creapy for me...', '2007-07-11 07:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3892264, 551930, 67152, '<td valign="top">beautiful colors and capture - love the placement.  This entry is completely title dependent, but it really is a good image so I will give it a 7</td>', 'beautiful colors and capture - love the placement.  This entry is completely title dependent, but it really is a good image so I will give it a 7', '2007-07-11 07:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
