(3892274, 552032, 79955, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed,dramatic lighting</td>', 'Nicely composed,dramatic lighting', '2007-07-11 07:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3892277, 552494, 52549, '<td valign="top">Now that is a real nightmare! I''ve just watched Stephen Kings "IT" and Pennywise frightens the sh*t out of me. Excellent work.</td>', 'Now that is a real nightmare! I''ve just watched Stephen Kings "IT" and Pennywise frightens the sh*t out of me. Excellent work.', '2007-07-11 07:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3892279, 552143, 79955, '<td valign="top">Well shot, nice lighting</td>', 'Well shot, nice lighting', '2007-07-11 07:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3892280, 552525, 79955, '<td valign="top">Like it a lot, excellent implementation</td>', 'Like it a lot, excellent implementation', '2007-07-11 07:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3892281, 552692, 79955, '<td valign="top">Very well thought out, well executed shot</td>', 'Very well thought out, well executed shot', '2007-07-11 07:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3892293, 551491, 67152, '<td valign="top">love the humor of this one - the ''expression'', if you can call it that, on the duck is quite funny - the tight crop really sells the shot</td>', 'love the humor of this one - the ''expression'', if you can call it that, on the duck is quite funny - the tight crop really sells the shot', '2007-07-11 08:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3892309, 552762, 67152, '<td valign="top">i really like the low angle and the lighting on this one -really good job with the exposure.  The blown out section of light pouring in from behind ands just the right contrast.  The title would have been more dramatic if it had simply stated - "Having No way out".</td>', 'i really like the low angle and the lighting on this one -really good job with the exposure.  The blown out section of light pouring in from behind ands just the right contrast.  The title would have been more dramatic if it had simply stated - "Having No way out".', '2007-07-11 08:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3892317, 551205, 67152, '<td valign="top">i like the blues and the lighting to show the waves/ water - but the lighting the frog seems a little frat and the cropping choice (tight on the sides) really closes this one down too much for me.  A square crop with more water may have worked better for this.</td>', 'i like the blues and the lighting to show the waves/ water - but the lighting the frog seems a little frat and the cropping choice (tight on the sides) really closes this one down too much for me.  A square crop with more water may have worked better for this.', '2007-07-11 08:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3892320, 549182, 67152, '<td valign="top">Funny image!  It is well captured and lit, it is nice and sharp and has good leading lines.  A couple of things that bug me a bit:  First, why three glasses?  It seems a little too cluttered - wouldn''t this guy only need one?  Second, the yellow bit holding up the whisky bottle is in view and really takes away from the image.  Really nice effort though!</td>', 'Funny image!  It is well captured and lit, it is nice and sharp and has good leading lines.  A couple of things that bug me a bit:  First, why three glasses?  It seems a little too cluttered - wouldn''t this guy only need one?  Second, the yellow bit holding up the whisky bottle is in view and really takes away from the image.  Really nice effort though!', '2007-07-11 08:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3892323, 552518, 67152, '<td valign="top">Solid perspective and use of shallow DOF, and I really like the recurring shapes in the image.  But the image seems to lack any real sharpness in the memorial in front to counterbalance the softness behind.</td>', 'Solid perspective and use of shallow DOF, and I really like the recurring shapes in the image.  But the image seems to lack any real sharpness in the memorial in front to counterbalance the softness behind.', '2007-07-11 08:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3892328, 552654, 67152, '<td valign="top">Creapy, creapy, creapy!  Well captured image - love the dirt on the hands and the lighting.  It kind of reminds me of the final scene in the movie "Carrie"</td>', 'Creapy, creapy, creapy!  Well captured image - love the dirt on the hands and the lighting.  It kind of reminds me of the final scene in the movie "Carrie"', '2007-07-11 08:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3892331, 552025, 67152, '<td valign="top">really nice fireworks shot  - too bad the silhoutted subjects are a ball field instead of a house - it would have likely come off better</td>', 'really nice fireworks shot  - too bad the silhoutted subjects are a ball field instead of a house - it would have likely come off better', '2007-07-11 08:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3892337, 550056, 67152, '<td valign="top">So you are secretly in love with Oprah?  Funny image and great ''surprised'' look.  I wish the newspaper gluing job was just a little better to carry this off.</td>', 'So you are secretly in love with Oprah?  Funny image and great ''surprised'' look.  I wish the newspaper gluing job was just a little better to carry this off.', '2007-07-11 08:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3892341, 551254, 67152, '<td valign="top">very, very, very, very creepy!  This really has nightmare written all over it.</td>', 'very, very, very, very creepy!  This really has nightmare written all over it.', '2007-07-11 08:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3892403, 551968, 67152, '<td valign="top">I had to google this to figure out what the heck it was - very scary stuff.  This is another example of strange things that strange people do...I can''t imaging how bad these people smell like after getting out of this muck.<br/> <br/>Good angle and low perspective on this shot</td>', 'I had to google this to figure out what the heck it was - very scary stuff.  This is another example of strange things that strange people do...I can''t imaging how bad these people smell like after getting out of this muck. Good angle and low perspective on this shot', '2007-07-11 08:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3892406, 551379, 67152, '<td valign="top">the choice of sepia was good for this image, but the super shallow DOF is really impacting the noise in the photo.</td>', 'the choice of sepia was good for this image, but the super shallow DOF is really impacting the noise in the photo.', '2007-07-11 08:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3892447, 550064, 67152, '<td valign="top">the processing on this really works well - very graphic in nature with the significant noise and harsh colors and lighting.</td>', 'the processing on this really works well - very graphic in nature with the significant noise and harsh colors and lighting.', '2007-07-11 08:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3892467, 550569, 67152, '<td valign="top">considering how lovable this stuffed guy must look like in color, you have done a nice job to convert to b/w. i like the tight crop on the head of this guy.</td>', 'considering how lovable this stuffed guy must look like in color, you have done a nice job to convert to b/w. i like the tight crop on the head of this guy.', '2007-07-11 08:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3892475, 551862, 67152, '<td valign="top">the blurry and blown out features of this work well to convey emotion - it really is a nightmare that people continue to smoke.</td>', 'the blurry and blown out features of this work well to convey emotion - it really is a nightmare that people continue to smoke.', '2007-07-11 08:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3892577, 552959, 67152, '<td valign="top">interesting skewed angle for this image - the lighting on the grave marker is really solid and the pained expression on the face adds some emotion to the shot</td>', 'interesting skewed angle for this image - the lighting on the grave marker is really solid and the pained expression on the face adds some emotion to the shot', '2007-07-11 08:50:59.000000', NULL, 1);
