(3897319, 552494, 38032, '<td valign="top">The texture of the clown skin and the well-highlited eyeball along with the black background -  even the direction the clowns eye is looking is great.  The subtle overall crop with nothing more than is needed  everyone can tell what it is but the brain / eye does need to look around to find out exactly what it is.  The subject is altogether good to because Im sure the average person sometimes wonders the very question Did I /  you lock the door?</td>', 'The texture of the clown skin and the well-highlited eyeball along with the black background -  even the direction the clowns eye is looking is great.  The subtle overall crop with nothing more than is needed  everyone can tell what it is but the brain / eye does need to look around to find out exactly what it is.  The subject is altogether good to because Im sure the average person sometimes wonders the very question Did I /  you lock the door?', '2007-07-12 10:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
