(3908233, 552797, 81390, '<td valign="top">This is more creepy than frightening, which is technically worse because creepy haunts you longer. This stands out because you didn''t need any strange lighting or makeup, just found your own subject. And even though it''s in a bunch of grass and leaves, you did a good job making it identifiable - beginning with the teeth.</td>', 'This is more creepy than frightening, which is technically worse because creepy haunts you longer. This stands out because you didn''t need any strange lighting or makeup, just found your own subject. And even though it''s in a bunch of grass and leaves, you did a good job making it identifiable - beginning with the teeth.', '2007-07-16 15:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3908323, 552961, 39679, '<td valign="top">Nice concept but the images, IMHO, are a bit soft and there is no clear point of interest.  To my mind making the larger, center image sharp (and therefor the center of focus), and the other images slightly more distinct than they are now, would have made this a truly interesting photo.  I''d love to see you do this again.</td>', 'Nice concept but the images, IMHO, are a bit soft and there is no clear point of interest.  To my mind making the larger, center image sharp (and therefor the center of focus), and the other images slightly more distinct than they are now, would have made this a truly interesting photo.  I''d love to see you do this again.', '2007-07-16 15:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
