(3911891, 552579, 41675, '<td valign="top">Lol - it took my eyes a moment to scan about and see the "face" in the closet. Nice job. Perhaps a little to some who quickly go from photo to phot, but I hope not.</td>', 'Lol - it took my eyes a moment to scan about and see the "face" in the closet. Nice job. Perhaps a little to some who quickly go from photo to phot, but I hope not.', '2007-07-17 22:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3911893, 552963, 41675, '<td valign="top">Eww, yeah, that''s gross and nightmarish. I like the concept. It appears a bit oversharpened for my taste though</td>', 'Eww, yeah, that''s gross and nightmarish. I like the concept. It appears a bit oversharpened for my taste though', '2007-07-17 22:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3911897, 552669, 41675, '<td valign="top">Wow. Very cool and freaky looking. Great entry into the challenge. Good luck.</td>', 'Wow. Very cool and freaky looking. Great entry into the challenge. Good luck.', '2007-07-17 22:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3911903, 551432, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like how the look in the eyes and the "wild" hair fit with your title. I wonder how this would look a with a bit more cropped off the left hand side.</td>', 'I like how the look in the eyes and the "wild" hair fit with your title. I wonder how this would look a with a bit more cropped off the left hand side.', '2007-07-17 22:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3911909, 552787, 41675, '<td valign="top">Good portrayal to get the message across to kids and strangers. I like the added effect of the playground in the background. I also think having this in black and white is very effective - especially the way you darkened the car to make it look "menacing."</td>', 'Good portrayal to get the message across to kids and strangers. I like the added effect of the playground in the background. I also think having this in black and white is very effective - especially the way you darkened the car to make it look "menacing."', '2007-07-17 22:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
