(3912233, 551970, 67697, '<td valign="top">What a cooool shot.  I think it''s a good shot for a candid.  The clouds look great!  The noise is the distraction in the photo, which is unfortunate because this is really cooool.  Do you have Noise Ninja?  I have something like it and can send you a link for it.  You''d be surprised what a difference it will make.<br/> <br/>Fun photo!</td>', 'What a cooool shot.  I think it''s a good shot for a candid.  The clouds look great!  The noise is the distraction in the photo, which is unfortunate because this is really cooool.  Do you have Noise Ninja?  I have something like it and can send you a link for it.  You''d be surprised what a difference it will make. Fun photo!', '2007-07-18 01:07:57.000000', NULL, 0),
