(3913350, 552287, 51538, '<td valign="top">Interesting to see that expensive lens in action.  It does pack a punch.  Nice work.</td>', 'Interesting to see that expensive lens in action.  It does pack a punch.  Nice work.', '2007-07-18 07:18:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(3913380, 552494, 38032, '<td valign="top">you did it! ... a well deserved ribbon for you -   Congrats!</td>', 'you did it! ... a well deserved ribbon for you -   Congrats!', '2007-07-18 07:39:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(3913386, 552525, 48954, '<td valign="top">Ah, well you are over the 6.00 marker which is cool...although anything under your average is always frustrating. This shot is very effective because it''s scary. The idea of suffocating like that is horrible and it well represented here. The lighting is super effective and highlights well the folds in the plastic bag caused by the suction in the mans attempts to breath. The facial expression is also good. One can see the worry in his eyes. My biggest problem is the crop. The shot is unbalanced. That whole left part is unnecessary in my opinion and it''s a little tight under the mouth. So all in all I think this is a very powerful image, the only problem is the crop and I think it''s underrated. I would have expected at least 6.3</td>', 'Ah, well you are over the 6.00 marker which is cool...although anything under your average is always frustrating. This shot is very effective because it''s scary. The idea of suffocating like that is horrible and it well represented here. The lighting is super effective and highlights well the folds in the plastic bag caused by the suction in the mans attempts to breath. The facial expression is also good. One can see the worry in his eyes. My biggest problem is the crop. The shot is unbalanced. That whole left part is unnecessary in my opinion and it''s a little tight under the mouth. So all in all I think this is a very powerful image, the only problem is the crop and I think it''s underrated. I would have expected at least 6.3', '2007-07-18 07:44:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(3913410, 552494, 20608, '<td valign="top">Well you got your ribbon man .... and a blue one to boot..<br/>CONGRATULATIONS DUDE!!!!!</td>', 'Well you got your ribbon man .... and a blue one to boot..CONGRATULATIONS DUDE!!!!!', '2007-07-18 07:59:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(3913417, 551865, 55838, '<td valign="top">WOO-HOOO!!  Congratulations Sweetie!  A rockin'' shot although (as her mommy) a little hard to think about - definitely a nightmare!  Nice work and I''ll see ya soon!</td>', 'WOO-HOOO!!  Congratulations Sweetie!  A rockin'' shot although (as her mommy) a little hard to think about - definitely a nightmare!  Nice work and I''ll see ya soon!', '2007-07-18 08:00:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(3913421, 552669, 20608, '<td valign="top">WOW !!!!! what a cool shot. I had a dream about drowning once and I woke to find that I was actually holding my breath too and sweating... close call.. This is an image that stirs inner emotions for me... GREAT!</td>', 'WOW !!!!! what a cool shot. I had a dream about drowning once and I woke to find that I was actually holding my breath too and sweating... close call.. This is an image that stirs inner emotions for me... GREAT!', '2007-07-18 08:03:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(3913429, 552494, 6630, '<td valign="top">I didn''t actually vote on at least 20% (I got too freaked out halfway through) but I did give this image a 10.  I clicked on it, looked away for something or other and then when I looked back at the screen I nearly jumped out of my skin.  I am not particularly afraid of clowns but this one really made me jump.  His expression is just creepy.  Good job!</td>', 'I didn''t actually vote on at least 20% (I got too freaked out halfway through) but I did give this image a 10.  I clicked on it, looked away for something or other and then when I looked back at the screen I nearly jumped out of my skin.  I am not particularly afraid of clowns but this one really made me jump.  His expression is just creepy.  Good job!', '2007-07-18 08:12:01.000000', NULL, 0),
