(3913481, 551295, 30536, '<td valign="top">As I write this, my son is in flight enroute home from a 16-month deployment in Iraq. Your image expresses what has been the nightmare in the back of our minds that entire time, and as someone else has said, it''s the real nightmares that are the scariest. <br/> <br/>I check this site weekly but rarely have time to comment. For this one I had to. Nice work.</td>', 'As I write this, my son is in flight enroute home from a 16-month deployment in Iraq. Your image expresses what has been the nightmare in the back of our minds that entire time, and as someone else has said, it''s the real nightmares that are the scariest.  I check this site weekly but rarely have time to comment. For this one I had to. Nice work.', '2007-07-18 08:32:47.000000', NULL, 0),
