(3913519, 551295, 52115, '<td valign="top">I once talked my son, Chris out of joining the Air Force and going to college instead. He also was going to get eye surgery to get his eyesight up to par for them. The irony is accidents can happen anywhere. He may have been safer going to Iraq. Some times things turn out bad, but let no one''s fear of a NIGHTMARE get in the way of their DREAMS.</td>', 'I once talked my son, Chris out of joining the Air Force and going to college instead. He also was going to get eye surgery to get his eyesight up to par for them. The irony is accidents can happen anywhere. He may have been safer going to Iraq. Some times things turn out bad, but let no one''s fear of a NIGHTMARE get in the way of their DREAMS.', '2007-07-18 08:44:48.000000', NULL, 0),
