(3914232, 551865, 50231, '<td valign="top">Very Nice Tim! Congrats!</td>', 'Very Nice Tim! Congrats!', '2007-07-18 12:15:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(3914245, 552736, 29011, '<td valign="top">It''s perfect. I''m glad you entered the photo. Placing in the top20 I''m sure you are too ;)  I''m not afraid of heights but the atmosphere of this shot can easily be found in a not so pleasant dream. Can also be seen as concept for "A rocky road downhill from here..." . I''m sure many can relate to that. Btw, it''s a +fave.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-07-19 10:50:53.</i></td>', 'It''s perfect. I''m glad you entered the photo. Placing in the top20 I''m sure you are too ;)  I''m not afraid of heights but the atmosphere of this shot can easily be found in a not so pleasant dream. Can also be seen as concept for "A rocky road downhill from here..." . I''m sure many can relate to that. Btw, it''s a +fave.', '2007-07-18 12:19:44.000000', '2007-07-19 11:50:53.000000', 0),
(3914268, 552553, 52549, '<td valign="top">When I see this really good image which is also perfect for the challenge, I''m totally surprised it didn''t do better. It was one of my top scorers, I love the lighting and the composition. The eyes having different shapes from looking from under the brow, the ring flash reflected in the eyes, the teeth bared and the light shining on the tip of the knife. Also the maniac look in the eyes is a real scarer. I would have wished you well over a 6. with this. Bummer that it''s so underrated.</td>', 'When I see this really good image which is also perfect for the challenge, I''m totally surprised it didn''t do better. It was one of my top scorers, I love the lighting and the composition. The eyes having different shapes from looking from under the brow, the ring flash reflected in the eyes, the teeth bared and the light shining on the tip of the knife. Also the maniac look in the eyes is a real scarer. I would have wished you well over a 6. with this. Bummer that it''s so underrated.', '2007-07-18 12:30:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(3914389, 551865, 68586, '<td valign="top">Surely every parents greatest nightmare . . <br/> <br/>A good subtle shot, if it was anymore complex it would distract.</td>', 'Surely every parents greatest nightmare . .  A good subtle shot, if it was anymore complex it would distract.', '2007-07-18 13:07:25.000000', NULL, 0),
