(3914932, 552978, 61961, '<td valign="top">Hi, I was one of your "8s" on this.  It may have had some technical problems that others found displeasing, but to me it really is nightmarish.  It took me awhile to figure out the perspective -- just like in a dream.  Plus the guy (you?) shirtless and with the beard looks a bit like a wildman.</td>', 'Hi, I was one of your "8s" on this.  It may have had some technical problems that others found displeasing, but to me it really is nightmarish.  It took me awhile to figure out the perspective -- just like in a dream.  Plus the guy (you?) shirtless and with the beard looks a bit like a wildman.', '2007-07-18 15:13:41.000000', NULL, 0),
