(4965704, 552732, 56502, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what your nightswimming dream is exactly, but the title and the picture remind me of a nightmare I often had as a child - something fell on me, like a crane, and I wanted to run away but I couldn''t as my feet wouldn''t move. Never found out how it went on, as I woke up before the final crash.<br/> <br/>So unlike some commenters I don''t miss the nightmare idea in this one at all, I think it communicates the idea quite well - at least to me.</td>', 'I don''t know what your nightswimming dream is exactly, but the title and the picture remind me of a nightmare I often had as a child - something fell on me, like a crane, and I wanted to run away but I couldn''t as my feet wouldn''t move. Never found out how it went on, as I woke up before the final crash. So unlike some commenters I don''t miss the nightmare idea in this one at all, I think it communicates the idea quite well - at least to me.', '2008-09-20 14:11:45.000000', NULL, 0),
